# CODEOWNERS - who reviews PRs touching each path.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner(s) below on a PR that changes a
# listed path. The `protected-main` ruleset does not need their approval
# to merge (checked 2026-10-03); it needs the `self-check` CI job.
# CONTRIBUTING.md says what judges a pull request.
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <owner1> [<owner2> ...]
# The last matching pattern wins, so put broad rules first, narrow last.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

